   "source": [
    "### Figure 6: Delivery or operational performance\n",
    "\n",
    "**Owner:** Echo\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** Do late deliveries receive lower ratings?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Observation unit and denominator:** One review; all 7,000 reviews are included.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tables and join keys:** `product_reviews` joined to `deliveries` on `order_id`.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Method:** Join each review to its delivery outcome. Check that the join keeps 7,000 rows, then compare the mean rating and number of reviews for on-time and late deliveries.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation and limitation:** \n",
    "\n",
    "Late deliveries average 3.82 stars, compared with 3.70 for on-time deliveries, so late deliveries are not rated lower in this data. \n",
    "\n",
    "Lim: Only reviewed items are included, and the late group is much smaller (707 reviews), so this may not represent all customers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "3db4fbb2",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-02T23:50:41.220765Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-02T23:50:41.220707Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-02T23:50:41.260993Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-02T23:50:41.260789Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Before join: 7,000 reviews\n",
      "After join: 7,000 rows, grain preserved\n",
      "          mean  count\n",
      "delivery             \n",
      "On time   3.70   6293\n",
      "Late      3.82    707\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 825x462 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
